WEBVTT

00:15:27.875 --> 00:15:30.851
da uljuljkaju mrtvaca na počinak.

00:15:30.875 --> 00:15:33.393
Naslovljena je „Da znam da pevam”.

00:15:33.417 --> 00:15:35.434
Da znam da pevam,

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:39.059
ne bih pevao o palom gradu Iliju

00:15:39.083 --> 00:15:40.768
i slavnoj prošlosti

00:15:40.792 --> 00:15:45.101
ili Hektorovoj krvi
koja je suva fleka u pesku.

00:15:45.125 --> 00:15:46.393
Ne.

00:15:46.417 --> 00:15:48.643
Pevao bih o osrtvu,

00:15:48.667 --> 00:15:50.434
daleko tamo na zapadu,

00:15:50.458 --> 00:15:55.518
kamenoj tvrđavi koju mrvi 
nadiruće more i šiba pena,

00:15:55.542 --> 00:15:59.059
opasanoj zidinama u dubokom modrom okeanu.

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:02.268
Druga Troja, irska Troja.